<section class="section" id="intron" aria-labelledby="intron-title">
        <div class="container lab">
          <div class="sec-head">
            <h2 id="intron-title">Featured lab: Intron</h2>
            <p>A Nigerian voice AI company. Its speech recognition powers 6 of our 13 chains, and it transcribes 57 languages.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lab-body">
            <article class="lab-card">
              <div class="lab-top">
                <span class="lab-tile"><img src="assets/kinyarwanda/logo-intron.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48" /></span>
                <span class="lab-status"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.2"/><path d="m5.4 8.2 1.8 1.8 3.4-3.6"/></svg>On Gooey.AI</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lab-id">
                <h3>Intron</h3>
                <span class="lab-country"><i class="flag-ng" aria-hidden="true"></i>Nigeria</span>
              </div>
              <p class="lab-blurb">Builds speech recognition and text to speech for African languages and accents, for health, finance, call centres and courts.</p>
              <div class="lab-rank">
                <div class="lab-rank-head"><span>In our leaderboard</span><span>6 of 13 chains</span></div>
                <ul id="labRank"></ul>
                <div class="lab-rank-key"><span><i class="sw sov"></i>Sovereign-deployable</span><span><i class="sw"></i>Private API</span></div>
              </div>
              <a class="site-link" href="https://intron.io/">intron.io<svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10 10 4M5 4h5v5"/></svg></a>
              <a class="lab-btn" href="https://gooey.ai/copilot/">Build an agent with Intron</a>
            </article>
            <div class="stands-out">
              <article class="usp usp-wide">
                <div class="usp-text">
                  <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h9M8.5 3v2M5.5 5c.6 3 2.700 5.400 5.500 6.800M11.500 5c-.8 3-3 5.600-6.500 7M13 20l4-9 4 9M14.300 17h5.400"/></svg>Follows language switches</h3>
                  <p>Understands speakers who mix languages mid-sentence: 12 bilingual models, plus a Kinyarwanda, English and French model that holds one conversation across all three. Intron says it is the first of its kind.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="usp-langs"><span><i style="background:var(--brand-blue)"></i>Kinyarwanda</span><span><i style="background:#565a66"></i>English</span><span><i style="background:#d6243a"></i>Français</span></div>
              </article>
              <div class="usp-row">
                <article class="usp"><h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.500 2.600 3.800 5.600 3.800 9S14.500 18.400 12 21c-2.500-2.600-3.800-5.600-3.800-9S9.500 5.600 12 3z"/></svg>57 languages, 500+ accents</h3><p>Transcribes 57 languages and more than 500 accents, from Kinyarwanda and Swahili to Yoruba and Zulu.</p></article>
                <article class="usp"><h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5.500 11a6.500 6.500 0 0 0 13 0M12 17.500V21"/></svg>Live speech in and out</h3><p>Streaming recognition returns text while someone is still talking. Streaming text to speech covers 13 languages, all through one API.</p></article>
              </div>
              <div class="usp-row">
                <article class="usp"><h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="10.500" width="14" height="10" rx="2.500"/><path d="M8.500 10.500V8a3.500 3.500 0 0 1 7 0v2.500"/></svg>Can run offline</h3><p>Sahara v2 can run on local hardware with no internet. A Nigerian clinic group used it offline for more than 2,000 consultations.</p></article>
                <article class="usp"><h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9.500 12 4l9 5.500M5 10.500V18M9.500 10.500V18M14.500 10.500V18M19 10.500V18M3 20.500h18"/></svg>Proven in Rwanda</h3><p>Irembo, Rwanda’s government services platform, benchmarked its Kinyarwanda recognition, then piloted it on more than 10,000 requests.</p></article>
              </div>
              <div class="customers">
                <span>Named on Intron’s site</span>
                <div><b>Irembo</b><b>Branch International</b><b>Ogun State Judiciary</b><b>Nairobi Health Center</b><b>PAMO Clinics</b></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="board-note">Facts come from Intron’s website and press coverage. Leaderboard figures are from our Aug 30, 2026 test.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
